<title>CHILE: Chile's Provida Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's Provida Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean pension fund manager Provida reported the following consolidated results in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>			   Q1 1997	    Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net earnings		   4.68		 5.50</p>
<p>Operating income	     5.43		 6.90</p>
<p>Non-operating income	  n/a		  n/a</p>
<p>Net revenues		  16.89		16.97</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
